        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 451812, Arched Sheridan Handleset with Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Sheridan Handleset has a rustic appearance thanks to the unique Sandcast Bronze material from which it is made. It is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Arched Sheridan Handleset with Covered Deadbolt comes with your choice of interior knob or lever. Choose from a dummy function or a single cylinder function. The Sheridan Sandcast Bronze Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Sandcast Bronze Traditional Sheridan Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Sheridan Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 16-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-7/8\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-45082-specifications.pdf?v=1704262356\"><b>Emtek 451812 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
