                "description": "The Sheridan Handleset has a rustic appearance thanks to the unique Sandcast Bronze material from which it is made. It is available in flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Arched Sheridan Handleset with Covered Deadbolt comes with your choice of interior knob or lever. Choose from a dummy function or a single cylinder function. The Sheridan Sandcast Bronze Handleset will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick.",
                "keywords": "Sandcast Bronze Sheridan Front Door Handlesets, Sheridan Sandcast Bronze Handlesets, Emtek 451812, Emtek 450812, Sheridan Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolts, Sandcast Bronze Traditional Sheridan Tubular Handlesets, Arched Sheridan Handleset with Covered Deadbolts, rustic handlesets, traditional handlesets,"
